WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.333
Subtracting three-digit numbers

2
00:00:04.533 --> 00:00:10.167
Our school has four hundred fifty-two students. Today two hundred twenty-eight students went on a trip. How many students stayed?

3
00:00:10.767 --> 00:00:14.400
Four hundred fifty-two minus two hundred twenty-eight.

4
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:18.033
We cannot take eight from two, so we break one ten.

5
00:00:18.033 --> 00:00:21.667
Now there are four tens and twelve ones.

6
00:00:21.667 --> 00:00:25.300
Twelve minus eight is four.

7
00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:28.933
Four tens minus two tens is two tens; four hundreds minus two hundreds is two hundreds.

8
00:00:28.933 --> 00:00:32.867
The answer is two hundred twenty-four.
